2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Dominee
2 CONT
2 CONT At the age of 22 year he took his honour degree (PhD) "Collectanea ad illustranda Jesu dicta ex observatione vital communio" at Deventer.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Evert was a highly talented man and, like his father, very eloquent. It was told he had a sharp tongue, however a respected debater. He was a membrer of the "Zeeuwse Genootschap der Wetenschappen" and he was the author of num
2 CONC erous (religious) documents such as:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Vervolg op de bloemlezing uit den Hollandsche Spectator van Justus van Effen", Gorinchem 1845 "Teekenen en Vragen des Tijds", Goes 1857 "Handleiding bij Godsdienstonderwijs" "Misbruikte bijbelplaatsen", Leiden 1864 "Het ideaal de
2 CONC r liefde", Goes 1886.
