1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Jan Christoffel Berrangé (“generally known as Johannes Christoffel Berrangé”) died in his home in Orange Street, Cape Town. Jan Christoffel Berrangé & Son of Burg Street, Cape Town were well-known “Attornies, Nota
2 CONC ries and Conveyancers”."
