1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Aunt Pesche or Penina Beilin - Biala was cited as aunt who was closest relative to cousin of Sarah (Abraham Beilin)  traveling on same boat.  Last residence Ostropol for both Sarah/children and the cousin.  Abraham Beilin was goin
2 CONC g to uncle Yankel Rosensaft - who was married to Sophie Biala
