1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charlotta Louisa was born on 5 October 1842. She was baptised in St George's Cathedral on 19 December 1842, the daughter of Charlotte Serurrier. The reputed father was recorded as Henry Dennis on the baptism record
2 CONC , although his real name was Hendrik Justinus Denyssen. Charlotte Serurrier and Hendrik Denyssen were not married but living together at the time. They also had a son named Hendrik Justinus in 1840 and another daughter named Clara
2 CONC  Christina in 1844.
2 CONT
2 CONT married  Tobias Andreas Johannes VOLSTEEDT, Butcher & Harbour Master, C.T.
2 CONT
2 CONT from Peleteret.co.za
2 CONT  ".... and another daughter who married a tug-master known as “Captain”. The latter couple produced a daughter who reputedly
2 CONT married into wealth."
2 CONT
2 CONT Note Marriage at age 20 in 1863 is given as with permission of father Henry Denyssen
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-D1P9-T1H?view=index&personArk=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AXKHG-MVC&action=view&cc=1478678&lang=en&groupId=M969-3NY
2 CONT
