1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francois Gerhard Jacob Brink, born: 1 January 1810, and baptised: 10 January 1810, Cape Town
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': http://www.angelfire.com/folk/brinkfamily/files/hoofstuk3.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT however, ''Suid-Afrikaanse geslagregisters'' give Francois' birthdate as 14 January 1810.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francois Gerhard Jacob (d2) Boer vanaf 1844 tot en met 1851 op sy plaas ‘Babilons Toen’. Rekords vir slegs ses kinders uit sy twee huwelike kan opgespoor word. Francois was nog eers 64 gewees tot hy oorlede is nie.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': http://www.angelfire.com/folk/brinkfamily/files/hoofstuk3.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ==========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE from Craig Sheldon''': Francois Brink's died sometime before 1864; his wife, Maria Berrange, is described as a Widow in her 1864 Death Notice.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ==========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT d2 Francois Gerhard Jacob, boer (en eienaar 1844-1851 van) 'Babilons Toren', Simondium *1.1.1810 =Kaapstad 14.1.1810 tvóór 1864 x Kstd 28.8.1837 Maria Magdalena BERRANGE *Kstd 1.8.1810 t(wed 53jr) Kstd 15.4.1864, dv Daniël Frederi
2 CONC k en Magdalena Elizabeth néé SERRURIER {Sy naam word op sy moeder se sterfkennis verkeerd as Francois Gerhardus gegee.}
2 CONT
2 CONT el Magdalena Elizabeth *Paarl 1.7.1838 =Paarl 10.9.1838 [Dalk klein dood] {'n Ander Paarl doopregister gee *17.8.1838 en =30.9.1838!}
2 CONT
2 CONT e2 Cornelis *Paarl 9.3.1840 =Paarl 17.5.1840 [Dalk jonk dood] 
2 CONT
2 CONT e3 Daniël Frederik Berrange *Paarl 6.3.1842 =Paarl 17.4.1842 
2 CONT
2 CONT e4 Johanna Maria *Paarl 9.11.1843 =Paarl 3.12.1843
2 CONT
2 CONT e5 Francois Gerhard Jacob (Frans) *Paarl 22. 1 2. 1 845 =Paarl 26.7.1846 {Waarskynlik die Francois Gerhardus Jacobus x Johanna Wilhelmina Philippina VAN DER LINDEN
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': Johan Brink, [http://books.google.com/books?id=wckWAQAAIAAJ ''Die Brink-familie van Suid-Afrika: 'n geslagregister van 1737 tot die hede''], Google Book Search
2 CONT
2 CONT ===============================
2 CONT
2 CONT A few years before his marriage to Maria Magdalena Berrange on 28 Aug. 1837, Francois Gerhard Jacob Brink snr. had a relationship with the Brink family slave, [http://www.geni.com/people/Philida-van-der-Kaap/6000000017615648356 ''
2 CONC 'Philida van der Kaap''']. According to the 22 Nov. 1832 records of the Assistant Protector of Slaves, Francois and Philida had four children together, including a daughter named [http://www.geni.com/people/Mamie/60000000176157081
2 CONC 57 '''Mamie'''].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': [http://cape-slavery-heritage.iblog.co.za/2008/04/13/philidas-story-exhibited-at-the-museum-de-caab-at-solms-delta-farm-in-franschhoek/ Cape Slave Heritage Blog]
2 CONT --------------------
