1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to his wife's, Henrietta Christine Brink, Estate Papers, Daniel Frederick Berrange Brink died in 1911. This date of death was confirmed by Daniel's Civil Death Record as 8 Jan. 1911 and by Daniel's graves
2 CONC tone.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================================
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Daniel's gravestone he was born 17 March 1842; this is likely incorrect, resulting from a conflation of Daniel's birth and christening dates; according to Johan Brink's book ''Die Brink-familie van Suid-Afrika'', Dani
2 CONC el was actually born 6 March 1842, and christened on 17 April 1842. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel was named after his mother's father, Daniel Frederik Berrange.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel, e3, is mentioned as "Daniel Brink" in the Estate Papers of Magdalena Elizabeth Berrangé, MOOC 13/1/344.13.
