2 CONT Two sons were listed as Louis in the 1910 census.  Uncle Louie was the next youngest before my father.  Uncle Yalek was a little older, so this must be a transcription error and the 14 year old must have been Uncle Yalek.  The pic
2 CONC ture of the family shows my father on one side (8 or 9) and a boy on the other side just a little older.  There is a boy in the back a few years older and that reminds me of Uncle Yalek.  He is next to an older boy and that must b
2 CONC e Avram or Abram.  It does not look like Max, who was older and married.
