2 CONT Rose married Jacob Gitter and had three children, Harold, Arthur and Lucille, who married Abe Miller.  She had 2 children, Sheila and Jay..
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruchell arrived on the same ship as her father Isaac.  Her closest relative in Ostropol was Sora Peshe (Sarah), which verifies my grandmother's name since I am named for her.  She and Isaac/Aizek were going to son and brother Mend
2 CONC el/Max
