2 CONT * Burke, Bernard, Sir.  [https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhera01byuburk#page/804/mode/2up A genealogical and heraldic history of the landed gentry of Great Britain & Ireland 6th ed]. London : Harrison 1879. Vol I. page 804
