2 CONT Cape Civil Deaths - Entry for November 1954 - Cornelia Sophia de Jager ( nee Nelson ) passed away on 5 November 1954 at the Groote Schuur Hospital, Observatory, Cape Town. She was aged 70 years, a housewife and a widow who lived a
2 CONC t 9 Taylor Road, Tiervlei, Bellville District.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died from Septicaemia and chronic Nephritis having been ill for one week with Dr R. Prosser attending. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Informant : D. Petersen - person causing burial - lives : 94 Bree Street, Cape Town
2 CONT
