1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Daniel Frederick Brink was married to and divorced from Octavia Harriet Drake, daughter of Henry Alfred Drake and Mary Elizabeth Carr.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.farr.co.za/genealogy/1880.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ===============
2 CONT
2 CONT William's "usual place of residence" is given as 55 Grant Avenue, Norwood, Johannesburg in his 1932 Death Notice. (Source: William Daniel Frederick Brink, Depot: TAB; Type: LEER; Vol. No.: 0; Syst.: 01; Ref.: 79706)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===============
2 CONT
2 CONT William's 1932 Death Notice describes him as unmarried and without children. (Source: William Daniel Frederick Brink, Depot: TAB; Type: LEER; Vol. No.: 0; Syst.: 01; Ref.: 79706)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===============
2 CONT
2 CONT According to William and Octavia's 1906 divorce record they had no children. They were married for just over a month before he left her on 7 Jan. 1903 claiming to go pay a bill and then never returning. Octavia tried again to look
2 CONC  for William in 1906, including posting adverts in newspapers, but to no avail. On 2 June 1906 Octavia was given leave to sue William as she only had her clothes and less than £10.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': Divorce record of William Daniel Frederick Brink and Octavia Harriet Drake, Cape Town Archives, KAB, CSC, 2/1/1/528, Ref.: 518
