1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John's full name - John Daniel Brink - can be found in the baptism record of Clara Martha Sophia Dryden, daughter of his sister, Henrietta Dryden nee Brink. '''Source''': FamilySearch.org
2 CONT
2 CONT ====================================
2 CONT
2 CONT The gravestone for John Brink was placed up against the gravestone of his father, Daniel Frederick Berrange Brink:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.egssa.org/library/main.php?g2_itemId=529352
2 CONT
2 CONT "In loving memory of my dear parents John Brink, Born 17 July 1865, Died 28 Jan 1916; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Susan Maria Brink, born Sinden, born 22 April 1864, died 28 May 1917
2 CONT
2 CONT Erected by their loving and only daughter Kitty"
2 CONT
2 CONT ============================
2 CONT
2 CONT John Daniel Brink's burial record incorrectly states his age when he died; he was 51 years old, not 21. The date of burial appears to be correct, confirmed by John's Civil Death record; the gravestone then has an inaccurate date o
2 CONC f 28 Jan. 1916, and should read 8 Jan. 1916. (Source: FamilySearch.org, "South Africa, Cape Province, Civil Deaths, 1895-1972", 1916: Claremont, Image no.: 7)
2 CONT
