1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henrietta Dryden nee Brink's middle name was also Christine, like her mother, according to the baptism certificate of Henrietta Alice Greyling nee Dryden.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE''': Henrietta Christina Dryden nee Brink had the nickname Lizzie according to the 1932 Death Notice of her brother, William Daniel Frederick Brink. The 1940 death record of Henrietta Christina Dryden nee Brink's daughter, 
2 CONC Henrietta Alice Greyling nee Dryden, gives Henrietta Christina's name as Elizabeth.
2 CONT
