1 NAME Reginald Clive Berrangé /van Ryneveld/
2 GIVN Reginald Clive Berrangé
2 SURN van Ryneveld
2 _MARNM van Ryneveld
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 JUL 1891
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1969
1 OCCU Attorney with Dempers & van Rynefeld. Played rugby for South Africa in 1910
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Clive van Ryneveld
2 CONT Full names: Reginald Clive Berrange
2 CONT Date of birth: 7 Jul 1891
2 CONT Place of birth: Graaff-Reinet
2 CONT School: SACS
2 CONT Springbok no: 124
2 CONT Debut test province: Western Province
2 CONT Date of death: 25 Aug 1969 (Age 78)
2 CONT
2 CONT Test summary: Tests: 2 Tries: 0
2 CONT First Test: 27 Aug 1910 Age:19 Halfback against Britain at Crusaders (St George's Park), Port Elizabeth
2 CONT Last Test: 3 Sep 1910 Age:19 Halfback against Britain at Newlands, Cape Town
2 CONT
2 CONT Test history:
2 CONT Date	Age	Position	Opponent	Result	Score	Venue	Prov
2 CONT 27 Aug 1910	19	Halfback	Britain	Lose: 3-8	 	Crusaders (St George's Park), Port Elizabeth	WP
2 CONT 03 Sep 1910	19	Halfback	Britain	Win: 21-5	 	Newlands, Cape Town	WP
2 CONT
2 CONT Van Ryneveld street : G.J. van Eck.
2 CONT VAN RYNEVELD, Reginald Clive Berrange is op 7 Julie 1891 in Kaapstad gebore, het onderrig aan S.A.C.S. ontvang en later as prokureur gepraktiseer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clive was Springbokagterspeler in 1910 teen die besoekende Britte, terwyl sy seun, Clive vir Engeland rugby gespeel het en S.A. krieketkaptein in 1956/7 was. 'n Ontydige besering het hom sy springbokkleure in rugby gekos.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pa Clive was die eerste springbok met 'n seun wat aan internasionale sport deelgeneem het.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clive het in 1910 vir die W.P.-kolleges en Kaapland ook gespeel, asook vir S.A. in die laaste internasionale wedstryd op 3 September op Nuweland waar sy span 'n wegholoorwinning van 21 : 5 oor die Britte behaal het - "a margin vic
2 CONC tory that was not equalled until 1955."
2 CONT
2 CONT BRONNE:
2 CONT (1) CRAVEN, Danie: Springboks Down the Years.
2 CONT (2) Rugby in Suid-Afrika.
2 CONT (3) CRAVEN, D. H.: Springhok-annale Rugby (1889-1964).
2 CONT
2 CONT - Uit Pretoriana: Rugby Springbokke na wie straatname in Danville, Pretoria, vernoem is
