1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Tasks: Add school documents and additional photos of events and family pictures.  Scan volunteer recognition cards. .
2 CONT
2 CONT As I look through the documents and photographs, I am struck by my mother embracing life as a teenager and young woman living her life.  She has pictures of girlfriends, flowers in her hair, a  trip to Cuba with her sister Jeannet
2 CONC te, and after I was born, plenty of home movies.  She was 2nd generation - They weren't rich, but her needs were well met.  She went to a good school for secretarial training and worked until marriage.  I plan to do an online albu
2 CONC m of her fashions from age 16.  She didn't wear fancy clothes, but she seems to have been fashionable and always looked nice.  The flowers in her hair became bows in my hair.
