2 CONT '''Brief Life History of Willem Jan 'William John' Neser'''
2 CONT When Willem Jan 'William John' Neser was born on 11 April 1903, in Cape Town, Cape, Cape Colony, South Africa, his father, Daniel Alexander Neser, was 34 and his mother, Sophia Johanna Maria de Klerk, was 32. He married:
2 CONT - '''PN NN''' before 1959, and
2 CONT - '''Kathleen Hope Knobel''' on 27 June 1959 in Sea Point, Cape Town, Cape Province, South Africa.
2 CONT He died on 3 February 1961, in Goodwood, Cape Province, South Africa, at the age of 57, and was buried in Maitland Cemetery, Maitland, Cape Town, Cape Province, South Africa.
2 CONT
